--- !u!114 &114411589050549502
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1613114419443702}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 540
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这修炼的功法以天阶为首，地阶次之，人阶则最为普通。相对的，越强大的功法也越难领悟，想要突破到高层更是需要上百年的苦修努力。所以从人阶功法开始打好基础，非常重要。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114901935359856380}
  AvatarIntID: 413
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114935447758757445
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1613114419443702}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 550
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 门派入门功法为《化尘诀》，此乃我教弟子必须修习的基础功法。尘，扬土也。化尘之窍在于沉可中正稳健，扬则灵动敏迅。{shidi}可配合我教入门神通《还尘》与《化沙》，仔细体悟其中法门。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114901935359856380}
  AvatarIntID: 413
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
